    <mxCell id="knote" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" value="Three brokers, not one: replication factor 3 with min.insync.replicas=2. A single-broker stack silently downgrades acks=all. Auto topic creation is off; partition counts come from topics.tsv.">
